<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="501468000"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="583731514"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Sacred Play Secret Place"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Matryoshka"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Virgin Babylon Records Sampler 20161126"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:17.548"><div begin="00:30.208" end="04:57.211"><p begin="00:30.208" end="00:35.959" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Gracefully sneaking up on me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们偷偷向我靠近</span></p><p begin="00:36.257" end="00:42.491" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">They just want to tear my feathers<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要折断我的羽翼</span></p><p begin="00:44.859" end="00:50.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">The golden light of the setting sun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夕阳金色的余晖下</span></p><p begin="00:50.940" end="00:56.541" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Let me be a hypocrite again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再次成为了一个伪君子</span></p><p begin="00:57.924" end="01:04.569" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I will be gone before long, I know I'm wrong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不久以后 我就要离开</span></p><p begin="01:05.441" end="01:11.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">No matter how far I go, they find me out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但无论我逃得再远 终究是穷途末路</span></p><p begin="01:14.241" end="01:20.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I wish the gusts took away my gloom<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但愿狂风能够卷走我的忧郁</span></p><p begin="01:20.522" end="01:26.541" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">I can't help this vague feeling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样的茫然失措我已不堪忍受</span></p><p begin="01:27.108" end="01:34.043" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">I feel so good, but I'm worn out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉如此美好 但我已经精疲力竭</span></p><p begin="01:34.507" end="01:41.491" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">We'll be alright, don't look so sad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都会好起来的 不要如此黯然神伤</span></p><p begin="01:41.889" end="01:48.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Confess my sin, conceal them all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忏悔我犯下的罪孽 但愿我能一一赎过</span></p><p begin="01:49.259" end="01:57.675" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Night will come soon and swallow everything<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜幕就要降临 用黑暗笼罩整个大地</span></p><p begin="02:13.697" end="02:19.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Quietly hiding in the grass<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄悄藏在草丛之下</span></p><p begin="02:19.563" end="02:25.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Hearing the leaves rustling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听着树叶窸窣作响</span></p><p begin="02:28.479" end="02:34.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">They're singing with a burning piano<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随着激情的钢琴演奏 他们在放声高歌</span></p><p begin="02:34.349" end="02:40.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">It gives me cheap relief<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切让我感到了一丝解脱</span></p><p begin="02:41.315" end="02:47.942" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">I will be gone before long, I know I'm wrong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不久以后 我就要离开</span></p><p begin="02:48.770" end="02:55.436" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">No matter how far I go, they find me out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但无论我逃得再远 终究是穷途末路</span></p><p begin="02:57.720" end="03:03.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">I wish the gusts took away my gloom<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但愿狂风能够卷走我的忧郁</span></p><p begin="03:03.987" end="03:09.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">I can't help this vague feeling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样的茫然失措我已不堪忍受</span></p><p begin="03:10.470" end="03:17.414" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">I feel so good, but I'm worn out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉如此美好 但我已经精疲力竭</span></p><p begin="03:17.914" end="03:24.691" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">We'll be alright, don't look so sad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都会好起来的 不要如此黯然神伤</span></p><p begin="03:25.226" end="03:32.309" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Confess my sin, conceal them all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忏悔我犯下的罪孽 但愿我能一一赎过</span></p><p begin="03:32.627" end="03:40.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Night will come soon and swallow everything<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜幕就要降临 用黑暗笼罩整个大地</span></p><p begin="04:09.655" end="04:16.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">I feel so good, but I'm worn out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一身轻松但我现已筋疲力尽</span></p><p begin="04:17.046" end="04:23.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">We'll be alright, don't look so sad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们终会无恙  何必忧心念想</span></p><p begin="04:24.365" end="04:31.317" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Confess my sin, conceal them all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对此供认不讳  深埋我的罪孽</span></p><p begin="04:31.317" end="04:40.102" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Night will come soon and swallow everything<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜幕降临之时  一切将被吞噬</span></p><p begin="04:39.120" end="04:43.357" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I feel so good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉如此美好</span></p><p begin="04:46.508" end="04:50.377" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">You'll be alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="04:53.844" end="04:57.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Then I give all up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终 我会放弃所有</span></p></div></body></tt>